# In-site redirects for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Redirects from the retired festival subdomains are not here: they cross
# origins, so they belong in Cloudflare Redirect Rules or Bulk Redirects at
# cutover, not in this file.
#
# /festival was the club's recurring "this year's festival" page.  It was
# deleted in e933ac6 when the site moved to Bulma, so the path has 404'd ever
# since - including for the old festival.berkeleyjuggling.org subdomain, which
# redirected to it.  Point it at the archive instead.

/festival     /festivals/  301
/festival/*   /festivals/  301
